g time-ignoring path (step_05, step_13) do not translate into a temporal cascade.", "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_04", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_05", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_06", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_07", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_08", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_09", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_10", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_11", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_14", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_15", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_16", "role": "support"}]}, "raw_final_response": "```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_a39ca297\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [318, 480],\n  \"window\": [14821, 53221],\n  \"confidence\": 0.75,\n  \"narrative\": \"No time-respecting, 600-unit-gap-bounded chain from 318 to 480 is supported by the evidence. (1) Structure: the 1-hop neighbourhoods are disjoint (step_03 out-neighbours of 318 vs step_04 in-neighbours of 480 share no node), and the full 2-hop neighbourhoods are also disjoint \u2014 the 43-node 2-hop set around 318 (step_14) contains none of the 21 nodes in 480's ego-net (step_06) \u2014 so even ignoring time any route requires >=4 hops through a very sparse graph (8136 events over 1960 nodes, repeat ratio 0.019, step_01). (2) Timing: the two nodes' activity is essentially anti-phased. 480 fires 10 events in [14821,20221], 5 in [20221,25621], 4 in [31021,36421], 1 in [36421,41821] and nothing thereafter (step_08), while 318 is silent in [14821,20221] and does 17 of its 23 events after 41821 (step_07), i.e. after 480 has gone quiet. In the only overlapping stretch (steps 11/12, 15/16) each node emits at most 1-2 isolated events per ~1400-unit bin, far too sparse to seed a 4+-hop relay in which every consecutive hop is within 600 units. (3) Confounder controls: total volume and node popularity do not help \u2014 318 (23 events) and 480 (20 events) are ordinary-degree nodes (step_02), and their late/early bursts are non-overlapping, so the raw activity counts and the existence of a long time-ignoring path (step_05, step_13) do not translate into a temporal cascade.\"\n  ,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_14\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"support\"}\n  ]\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 64846, "total_output_tokens": 8458, "total_tokens": 73304, "total_latency_ms": 119478, "llm_calls": 9, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}